# Reviewed exceptions for scripts/check-neutral.sh. One "path:match" per line;
# "path:*" accepts every hit in one file. Add a line only after checking that the
# match is a public vendor domain, a test fixture or a code expression, and not
# anyone's real infrastructure.
#
# tools/floorplan is bundled third-party code (Hayden Smith's Floorplan, MIT).
# Its hits are: public vendor and standards domains in docs and source, made-up
# domains in test fixtures, JavaScript property reads such as "s.app" that look
# like hostnames, the original author's waitlist service and contact address in
# his own privacy page, and licence addresses in the bundled elkjs layout engine.
tools/floorplan/skills/floorplan/assets/vendor/elk.bundled.js:apache.org
tools/floorplan/skills/floorplan/assets/vendor/elk.bundled.js:eclipse.org
